\b\fs32 Data Types\par
\b0\fs22 Data types are declarations for variables. This determines the type and size of  data associated with variables which is essential to know since different data  types occupy different sizes of memory.\par
There are 2 types of Data Types :\par
Primitive Data types : to store simple values\par
Non-Primitive Data types : to store complex values\par
