Boxing  --> \b0 Converting primitive \f1\u8594? object\f0\lang1033  (Manual Boxing)\par
int x = 10;\par
Integer obj = Integer.valueOf(x);\par
\par
\b Unboxing  --> \b0 Converting object \f1\u8594? primitive\par
Integer obj = 20;\par
int x = obj.intValue();\par
\f0\lang1033\par
\b Autoboxing  --> \b0 Java automatically converts primitive \f1\u8594? wrapper object\f0\lang1033\par
Integer obj = 100;\par
\par
\b Auto-unboxing \b0 --> Wrapper object \f1\u8594? primitive automatically.\par
Integer obj = 50;\par
int x = obj;\par
