\b Enum in Java\par
\b0 A special \f0\lang1033 data type used to define a collection of constant values.\par
\par
enum Day \{\par
    MONDAY,  TUESDAY,  WEDNESDAY\par
\}\par
\par
public class Main \{\par
\par
    public static void main(String[] args) \{\par
\par
        Day d = Day.MONDAY;\par
\par
        System.out.println(d);  // single value \par
\par
// for get all the values \par
\par
    Day []name=Day.values(); //return array\par
\par
\par
    \}\par
\}\par
