\cf3\b0 1.For CLASS\b\par
\cf0\b0 Variables (fields) --> Decided by  Reference type --> Time Compile-time\par
Methods (overridden) --> Decided by Object type --> Time Runtime\par
\cf3\par
2. For INTERFACE\par
\cf0 Methods (abstract / default) --> Decided by Object type --> Time Runtime\par
Variables (all are static final) --> Decided by Reference type  --> Time Compile-time\par
Static methods --> Called by Interface name only --> No polymorphism\b\par
