\fi-360\li720\ri-874\sl240\slmult1\qj  Extending Thread class\line\b0 class MyThread extends Thread \{\line     public void run() \{\line        System.out.println("Thread is running...");\line    \}\line\}\line\line public class Main \{\line     public static void main(String[] args) \{\line         MyThread t1 = new MyThread();\line         t1.start();  // start thread\line     \}\line\}\line\b\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Implementing Runnable interface (Recommended)\par

\pard\li710\ri-874\sl240\slmult1\qj\b0 class MyRunnable implements Runnable \{\par
    public void run() \{\par
        System.out.println("Thread is running...");\par
    \}\par
\}\par
\par
public class Main \{\par
    public static void main(String[] args) \{\par
        Thread t1 = new Thread(new MyRunnable());\par
        t1.start();\par
    \}\par
\}\b\par

